==Italian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|it|la|[[ad]] [[paene]]||almost}}. Unrelated to {{m|it|pena||pain, punishment}}.

Compare {{cog|ca|a penes}}, {{cog|eo|apenaŭ}}, {{cog|fr|à peine}}, {{cog|io|apene}}, {{cog|pt|apenas}}, and {{cog|es|apenas}}.

